      'MODLL contains only latitude, longitude, height and structural metadata. It has **no sensor-angle, per-pixel quality or scan-timing arrays**. Those fields could not be compared to MODLL and were not assigned agreement or filled. The exact named full MOD remains their source. There is no measured full/light coordinate offset to explain the observed native classification contrast; shared absolute geolocation error and thermal band-registration uncertainty remain unquantified.','',
      '## Version-specific QA applicability matrix','',
