      'Current official C2 collection metadata still links the older user guide and 2019 C1 NPP_PR14 V1.4.3 file specification. A guessed `/filespec/VIIRS/2/VNP14` route returned 404. The public Earthdata product/release pages returned 403 through the web fetch; that is not an Earthdata-authentication diagnosis. C2 IMG and operational NRT documentation were not substituted.','',
      '**Precise outstanding request:** obtain a citable, version-controlled QA mapping or explicit applicability statement for this exact SP NPP_PR14 1.6.1/PGE 2.0.4 production, covering input quality, trim/bowtie, cloud, background and rejection flags. `phase10/NASA_SUPPORT_QUESTION.md` contains the exact filenames, hashes, versions and three technical questions. It is a draft and was **not sent**.','',
