    for k,label in [('375_scan_center_pitch_m','375 m, scan'),('375_track_center_pitch_m','375 m, track'),('750_scan_center_pitch_m','750 m, scan'),('750_track_center_pitch_m','750 m, track')]:lines.append(f"| {label} | {min(r[k] for r in a['rows']):.6f} | {max(r[k] for r in a['rows']):.6f} |")
    lines+=['', f"Each pitch is a WGS84 distance to the next stored center in that array direction. Independent scalar Vincenty and production PROJ Geod differ by at most {o['max_sampling_pitch_implementation_difference_m']:.12g} m numerically; this is not geolocation accuracy. HSI/center spacing is not an optical response boundary. Literature PSF approximations explicitly allow along-scan response overlap. No rectangle, midpoint polygon, GRing or nominal 375/750 m square was used as a footprint.",'',
      'No source-qualified absolute response/registration bound for these exact thermal pixels was obtained. Physical shared area and registration bound therefore remain null, not zero. The floor(row/2), floor(column/2) index association and the Phase 9 nearest-center distances remain unchanged; aggregation-zone evidence does not turn them into proof of physical containment.','',
      'All selected pairs retain scan 27 and identical full-scan UTC bounds, 2023-06-13T10:42:48.055018Z–2023-06-13T10:42:48.618817Z. Different band integration/sample times prevent treating these as exact simultaneous pixel exposures. The selected Aqua scan-separation bound remains 68.956359 s; Phase 8 full-AOI bound remains 75.16694808 s. Neither short timing nor the unchanged view screens qualifies shared spatial support.','',
      '## Auditable sixteen-pixel reevaluation','',
      '| ID | 375 row,col | 750 row,col | Allocated FRP MW | Center separation m | 750 mask / QA | Verdict |','|---|---|---|---:|---:|---|---|']
